    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "1a3c0cfabba12ed1a7c2": "This outfit really brings out the blue in my eyes, don't you think? It should be obvious I have plenty of skill to go around, so I can afford to share a few of my tricks of the trade. Listen up, okay?",
        "3cb5f2114b241f0c201f": "There's nothing I can teach you, other than maybe a better eye for color and detail. Talk to Simon Tanner over there; he knows a lot of advanced techniques for working with leather.",
        "d54275669efa602e061d": "Train me.",
        "ef6f83aecb0ded9e1452": "I already know a lot about style. Now it's just a matter of mastering the techniques for working with leather. Good thing Simon's a real sport about helping me learn them."
      },
      "name": "Randal Worth",
      "subName": "Journeyman Leatherworker",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
